      "text": "利州路轉運使",
      "place_id": "hixiclu1dr0n",
      "sources": [
        {
          "title": "《宋史》卷三百零八·張佶傳",
          "source_bid": "d59f2gonq7sy",
          "details": "賊平，分川峽為四路，以佶為利州路轉運使。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "office_id": "hiximda1c3l0",
      "text": "如京使",
      "sources": [
        {
